[h1]HWMP Patch 2.4.6[/h1]
Standalone Homeworld Remastered patch for the original four races, based on Players Patch 2.3 Test build 21. Use this complete package by itself and matching archives on every multiplayer peer.

[h2]Support Units removed[/h2]
Support Units have been removed in 2.4.6. HWRM's native cap accounting did not reliably enforce the weighted fleet budget: some low-cost ships contributed no supply, and construction could stop too early or exceed the intended limit. Classic unit caps are restored; the other fixes and localization improvements remain.

[b]Почему убраны СУ:[/b] движок ненадёжно считал общий бюджет: часть дешёвых кораблей не занимала СУ, а строительство могло блокироваться раньше лимита или превышать его. В 2.4.6 возвращены классические лимиты; остальные исправления сохранены.

[h2]Improvements retained[/h2]
Gravity-well restoration and specific tested save/load fixes; support-frigate cargo recovery; capture/self-destruct permissions; independent docking recovery; Taiidan missile defense; Vaygr Medium missile binding; two scoped missile corrections; six-collector starts; approved Assault Frigate accuracy coefficient 1.2; six-language timing tooltips; Russian naming corrections; four race emblems and menu music.

[h2]Validation limits[/h2]
Source, Lua 4, regression and full seven-BIG payload checks passed. A basic native launch and owner visual check completed; full matches and two-client validation of this release remain pending. Old active-gravity saves predating the journal are not guaranteed. Please report version/archive hashes, mode, race and reproducible actions.

